The '''Burned Tower''', formally known as the Brass Tower, is located in [[Ecruteak City]]. It was burnt down by a lightning strike 147 years prior to the events of this game.

It now is inhabited by Ghost Pokémon, and [[Gym Leaders#Morty|Morty]] often trains there.

